  m_Text: "Forces are all around us \u2014 from pushing a door to pulling a drawer.
    But did you know that the way forces act can determine whether an object stays
    still, moves, or changes direction? This is where balanced and unbalanced forces
    come in. In this lesson, we'll explore how these forces work and how they affect
    the motion of objects in our everyday lives.\n\n"
