  m_Text: "The particle model helps explain heat transfer. When particles gain heat,
    they move faster and spread energy. In conduction, particles collide in solids.
    In convection, warm particles in liquids or gases rise while cooler ones sink.
    In radiation, heat travels as waves without particles, like the Sun\u2019s heat
    reaching Earth."
